<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "An EMMO domain ontology for multi-scale computational simulation of permanent magnetic materials, covering DFT through spin dynamics to micromagnetics, with support for literature annotation and reproducibility assessment."@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-05-22"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Generated via NEON-GPT methodology, validated L1-L4" .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode" .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Permanent Magnet Multi-Scale Simulation Ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "v2.0.0 — CQ-driven enrichment, self-checked, ABox cleaned, strict filtered. Removed SmCo/Ferrite/AlNiCo (no-pattern leaf classes). Updated 2026-05-30."@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.0.0" .
