<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#CurieTemperature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The critical temperature above which a ferromagnet becomes paramagnetic, losing spontaneous magnetization. Nd2Fe14B: 585K, SmCo5: 1020K."@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#CurieTemperature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The critical temperature above which a ferromagnet becomes paramagnetic, losing spontaneous magnetization. Nd2Fe14B: 585K, SmCo5: 1020K. Not present in MagMO v1.0.0."@en .
