<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#DFTStep> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "noncollinear magnetic calculation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#DFTStep> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "DFTStep"@en .
