# https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK3
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/magnetic-material#MagnetocrystallineAnisotropyConstantK2> .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "K3 is the third-order magnetocrystalline anisotropy constant, a direct higher-order sibling of magmo:MagnetocrystallineAnisotropyConstantK2 and magmo:MagnetocrystallineAnisotropyConstantK1; the ontology has K1 and K2 but lacks K3, making this a genuine gap requiring a new subclass under the same parent."@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "magnetic anisotropy constant k3" .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "magnetic anisotropy constant k3"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK4
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/magnetic-material#UniaxialAnisotropyConstant> .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Magnetic anisotropy constant K4 is the fourth-order uniaxial magnetocrystalline anisotropy constant; while magmo:MagnetocrystallineAnisotropyConstantK2 is the closest existing class (second-order), K4 is a distinct higher-order term not currently represented, requiring a new subclass MagnetocrystallineAnisotropyConstantK4 under magmo:UniaxialAnisotropyConstant."@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "magnetic anisotropy constant k4" .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "How is the magnetic anisotropy constant K4 computed? — extracted by fitting the torque curve from constrained Monte Carlo simulations"@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticAnisotropyConstantK4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "magnetic anisotropy constant k4"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticExchangeCouplingConstant
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticExchangeCouplingConstant> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticExchangeCouplingConstant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/magnetic-material#ExchangeStiffnessConstant> .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticExchangeCouplingConstant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The magnetic exchange coupling constant J (pairwise R-Fe, Fe-Fe) is a distinct atomistic quantity from magmo:ExchangeStiffnessConstant (a micromagnetic continuum parameter); no existing magmo: class captures the pairwise Heisenberg exchange parameter, so a new subclass is required under the exchange interaction branch."@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticExchangeCouplingConstant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticExchangeCouplingConstant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "magnetic exchange coupling constant" .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticExchangeCouplingConstant> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "How is the magnetic exchange coupling constant calculated? — calculated using the Liechtenstein formula"@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#MagneticExchangeCouplingConstant> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "magnetic exchange coupling constant"@en .
