<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#ZeemanEnergyDensity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Zeeman energy density is a distinct micromagnetic energy density term (-μ₀Ms·H) not expressible by any existing magmo: class; magmo:MagnetocrystallineAnisotropyEnergy is the closest structural analogue as a volumetric magnetic energy density, satisfying the GAP criterion for a new subclass in M3_Material."@en .
