<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#FixedSpinMoment(fsm)Calculation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Fixed spin moment (FSM) calculation is a constrained DFT method in which the total magnetic moment is fixed to study magnetisation-dependent properties of permanent magnets; it is a sub-method of pm:DFTStep not currently represented as a distinct class, warranting a new subclass under emmo:Computation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale#FixedSpinMoment(fsm)Calculation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/pm-multiscale> .
